 <h3><u>Rida Laake Udha de</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p><span aagayi hai shaam<br></span> Meri rida ke pasbaan<br> Rida laake ke urha de<br> (Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de) x3</p> 
  <p><span 0, 0)>Rida laake ke urha de</span><br> (Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de) x3<br> <br> agar wo toko salaasil se paaye azaadi<br> To mera abide bimaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de</p> 
  <p>Ye dard abide muztar ki jaan lelega<br> Guzar na jaaye dilafgar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de</p> 
  <p><span 0, 0)>Sabeel aisi banaa koi tay ho ye raste</span><br> Na dekhe mujhko sitamghaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de</p> 
  <p><span 0, 0)>Tu dekh sakta nahi ghazi berida mujhko</span><br> Sina se gir nahi farwa,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de</p> 
  <p><span 0, 0)>Tamaam umr me phir tujhse khuchh na mangungi</span><br> Hai ibne haidere karrar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de</p> 
  <p><span 0, 0)>Sawali koi tere dar se kab gaya khali</span><br> Zamane bhar ke madadghaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de<br> <br> Tu barh ke logo(n) se kehta tha band karo bazaar<br> Wahi behan wahi bazaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de</p> 
  <p><span 0, 0)>Padar bhi rote hai nana bhi bas yahi kehkar</span><br> Khule saro(n) ke wafadar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar</p> 
  <p>ye buturab ki beti ho kyu(n) na fariyaadi<br> <span 0, 0)>Wo beridayi ke sadme ko kaise jhelega<br> <span 0, 0)>Mujhe chhupale mere ghazi in nigaaho(n) se<br> <span 0, 0)>Ghareeb hogayi ummat ne di saza mujhko<br> <span 0, 0)>Tujhe sakina ke ashko(n) ki hai qasam ghazi<br> <span 0, 0)>Tujhe to baba ne bakhshi masnade aali<br> <span 0, 0)>Kabhi jo ghar se nikalti me saal me ik baar<br> <span 0, 0)>Sare hussain bhi rota hai noke neza par<br> <span 0, 0)>Sada ye shaam se aati hai mazahar-o-irfan</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br> Tarap ke aaj bhi kehti hai zainabe zeeshaan<br> Meri rida ke nigehbaan,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Ay mere ghazi alamdaar,&nbsp;Rida laake ke urha de<br> Khula hai sar khule bazaar rida laake urha de</p> 
